<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xml:lang="ja" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Wake Atte"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="MIREI"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1555193620"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">陷在身旁的沙发里读着书</text><text for="L2">你甚至连呼吸这件事</text><text for="L3">都像忘记了一般神情专注</text><text for="L4">宛如快要溺死在这房间里</text><text for="L5">耐不住安静的我总爱跑去</text><text for="L6">扰乱你而挨你责怪呢</text><text for="L7">那些小事我至今仍会忍不住回想</text><text for="L8">可现在的你早就放下了吧</text><text for="L9">成对的耳钉也好 带耳朵的发箍也罢</text><text for="L10">如今都只是静静搁置在一旁</text><text for="L11">彻底忘掉这种事 本以为轻而易举</text><text for="L12">如今却不得不把一切都放下</text><text for="L13">我们一直以来</text><text for="L14">满是过错 尽是含糊</text><text for="L15">只是太过笨拙 害怕正面相对</text><text for="L16">爱情一定也感到心灰意冷 将我们彻底抛弃</text><text for="L17">与你有关的那些点点滴滴</text><text for="L18">就像从一开始便未曾发生</text><text for="L19">漫无目的打开的电视机</text><text for="L20">像是驱散寂寞的咒语一般</text><text for="L21">也要和这间采光不佳的房间道别了</text><text for="L22">或许我也只是在落荒而逃</text><text for="L23">在空荡荡的日常里 明明并未刻意找寻</text><text for="L24">却总会不自觉看见你的身影</text><text for="L25">沙发右边凹陷的印记至今仍如化石一般</text><text for="L26">正因为记得太清楚 所以把它扔掉了哦</text><text for="L27">虽然嘴上总抱怨拥挤狭小</text><text for="L28">吵吵嚷嚷各有苦衷</text><text for="L29">磕磕绊绊一人一半</text><text for="L30">书桌 床铺 沙发 都各占一半</text><text for="L31">彻底放下 果然讨厌 不过是逞强罢了</text><text for="L32">说什么想见我 这种暧昧的谎言</text><text for="L33">别借着酒劲 跑来联络我啊</text><text for="L34">随之动摇又深感心力交瘁</text><text for="L35">看吧正因为如此 我一直都</text><text for="L36">我们一直以来</text><text for="L37">尽是犯错 尽是含混</text><text for="L38">只是过于笨拙 害怕坦诚相对</text><text for="L39">为了我们彼此都能好好向前 就彻底忘了我吧</text><text for="L40">哪怕问起我究竟是谁</text><text for="L41">就像从一开始便不曾相识</text><text for="L42">要是真能那样该有多好</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="4:17.990"><div begin="0:01.001" end="4:17.990"><p begin="0:01.001" end="0:07.311" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:01.001" end="0:01.881">隣</span><span begin="0:01.881" end="0:02.271">で</span><span begin="0:02.271" end="0:02.781">ソ</span><span begin="0:02.781" end="0:03.311">ファー</span><span begin="0:03.311" end="0:03.911">に</span><span begin="0:04.221" end="0:05.161">沈ん</span><span begin="0:05.161" end="0:05.491">で</span><span begin="0:05.521" end="0:06.601">本</span><span begin="0:06.601" end="0:07.141">を読</span><span begin="0:07.141" end="0:07.311">む</span></p><p begin="0:07.731" end="0:13.711" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:07.731" end="0:08.451">君</span><span begin="0:08.451" end="0:08.641">は</span><span begin="0:08.951" end="0:09.121">呼</span><span begin="0:09.121" end="0:10.041">吸</span><span begin="0:10.041" end="0:10.171">を</span><span begin="0:10.471" end="0:10.821">す</span><span begin="0:10.821" end="0:11.361">る</span><span begin="0:11.361" end="0:12.131">事</span><span begin="0:12.131" end="0:12.671">さ</span><span begin="0:12.671" end="0:13.231">え</span><span begin="0:13.231" end="0:13.711">も</span></p><p begin="0:14.079" end="0:19.929" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:14.079" end="0:14.719">忘</span><span begin="0:14.719" end="0:14.919">れ</span><span begin="0:14.919" end="0:15.109">る</span><span begin="0:15.459" end="0:15.899">く</span><span begin="0:15.899" end="0:16.149">ら</span><span begin="0:16.149" end="0:16.309">い</span><span begin="0:16.309" end="0:16.989">に</span><span begin="0:17.249" end="0:17.889">真</span><span begin="0:17.889" end="0:18.539">剣</span><span begin="0:18.539" end="0:18.939">な</span><span begin="0:19.049" end="0:19.479">顔</span><span begin="0:19.479" end="0:19.929">で</span></p><p begin="0:20.234" end="0:25.554" itunes:key="L4" ttm:age