ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:39.984" end="0:40.524">そん</span><span begin="0:40.524" end="0:40.714">な</span><span begin="0:40.714" end="0:41.194">事</span><span begin="0:41.194" end="0:41.744">ま</span><span begin="0:41.744" end="0:42.174">だ</span><span begin="0:42.254" end="0:43.054">思</span><span begin="0:43.054" end="0:43.324">い</span><span begin="0:43.324" end="0:43.614">出</span><span begin="0:43.614" end="0:43.804">し</span><span begin="0:43.804" end="0:43.944">て</span><span begin="0:43.944" end="0:44.174">し</span><span begin="0:44.174" end="0:44.664">ま</span><span begin="0:44.664" end="0:45.484">うん</span><span begin="0:45.484" end="0:45.784">だ</span></p><p begin="0:45.787" end="0:52.287" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:45.787" end="0:46.237">で</span><span begin="0:46.237" end="0:46.617">も</span><span begin="0:47.027" end="0:47.867">君</span><span begin="0:47.867" end="0:48.247">は</span><span begin="0:48.479" end="0:49.407">もう</span><span begin="0:49.407" end="0:50.357">違</span><span begin="0:50.357" end="0:50.957">うん</span><span begin="0:50.957" end="0:51.137">だ</span><span begin="0:51.137" end="0:52.287">ろ？</span></p><p begin="0:52.983" end="0:59.173" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:52.983" end="0:53.843">お揃</span><span begin="0:53.843" end="0:54.093">い</span><span begin="0:54.093" end="0:54.503">の</span><span begin="0:54.503" end="0:54.843">ピ</span><span begin="0:54.843" end="0:54.983">ア</span><span begin="0:54.983" end="0:55.203">ス</span><span begin="0:55.203" end="0:55.843">も</span> <span begin="0:56.223" end="0:56.763">耳</span><span begin="0:56.763" end="0:56.953">付</span><span begin="0:56.953" end="0:57.333">き</span><span begin="0:57.333" end="0:57.763">の</span><span begin="0:57.763" end="0:57.913">カ</span><span begin="0:57.913" end="0:58.323">チュー</span><span begin="0:58.323" end="0:58.513">シャ</span><span begin="0:58.513" end="0:59.173">も</span></p><p begin="0:59.699" end="1:05.579" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:5